A NOTE ON THE DATA

The revenue figures in data/ are estimates compiled and modelled from public
sources, listed in research/RESEARCH-NOTES.md. They are not the property of, and
carry no endorsement from, Newzoo, DFC Intelligence, Circana/NPD, JAMMA, Pelham
Smithers, Visual Capitalist, or any of the companies whose platforms appear in
the chart. Company names, console names and game titles are trademarks of their
respective owners and are used here descriptively.

Quarterly values are modelled, not measured. See the README before citing
anything from this project.
